[[0,2943362,0,1,0,1,"2018-12-31T00:56:38","Slimpickens1","",[],"<p>Jesus healed a a leaper. Just seeing how many negative comments I get from this. The more I get the more my faith grows</p>","Jesus healed a leaper","","theawakening"],[1,15843719,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:10:02","adrianveidt","[e]",[],"<p>how does one heal a leaper? talk him off the ledge? Or did he reassemble the pavement soup that was the leaper?</p>"],[2,15843983,15843719,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:28:03","Slimpickens1","",[],"<p>Pardon me lepor</p>"],[2,15844116,15843719,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:38:06","Slimpickens1","",[],"<p>Keep on</p>"],[1,15843729,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:10:53","Drunkenst","",[],"<p>One of 37 recorded</p>"],[1,15843843,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:18:54","Shagnasty68","",[],"<p>Leper</p>"],[1,15843956,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:26:24","Slimpickens1","",[],"<p>Leper . Thanks for letting me know.</p>"],[2,15846287,15843956,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T04:15:40","NE_Beaver","",[],"<p>Great post bro! I believe! One day every knee shall bow. God Bless brother!</p>"],[1,15844059,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:33:17","Slimpickens1","",[],"<p>The shills are on . Just mention Jesus and the demons of the English language attack you.</p>"],[1,15844062,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:33:21","Ramon710","",[],"<p>Most people nowadays do not understand the implications of that. \r</p>\n<p>2000 years ago being a leper can be equated to nowadays a late 4th-stage bone cancer. Something totally incurable and terminal </p>\n<p>Jesus told us that we could do greater things than those that he did. Why don't we?</p>"],[1,15844083,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:35:08","Slimpickens1","[e]",[],"<p>I can spell this shills JESUS! You deal with that.</p>"],[1,15844301,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:50:13","DamnLiquor","[e]",[],"<p>Yes Jesus cured Leprosy...</p>\n<p>the important part is that he used an anointing oil made from cannabis (marijuana flowers), olive oil, myrrh and cinnamon to do it</p>"],[2,15845490,15844301,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T03:17:10","HispGMa","",[],"<p>Jesus did NOT need oils to heal</p>"],[1,15844353,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T01:55:14","akilyoung","[e]",[],"<p>A leaper is one who leaps or jumps. \r</p>\n<p>A lepor is one who is having body parts rot off.</p>"],[2,15854551,15844353,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T18:28:13","KarlKastner","",[],"<p>Leper</p>"],[3,15855560,15854551,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T19:36:29","akilyoung","",[],"<p>Lmao i guess no one can spell it</p>"],[1,15844764,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T02:21:52","SEC_TEST","",[],"<p>I love playing leap frog!</p>"],[1,15845125,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T02:47:31","jessewag","",[],"<p>Wish I could of seen that. Never experienced for myself such a miracle.</p>"],[1,15845398,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T03:09:50","Shagnasty68","",[],"<p>There's a cure for it in the bible</p>"],[1,15846136,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T04:05:31","NE_Beaver","",[],"<p>Reading this thread is the best laugh I've had all day.</p>"],[2,15850939,15846136,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T14:11:43","Slimpickens1","[e]",[],"<p>Got to admit. It is funny! Didn't mean to misspell it.</p>"],[3,15852595,15850939,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T16:29:13","NE_Beaver","",[],"<p>Just so you know, I wan't laughing at the misspelling, That happens to us all. I was laughing at the feed comments as they were laid out when I read them It was a classic flow and your response about the English language demons was a hilarious cherry on top. Cheers!</p>"],[4,15853605,15852595,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T17:36:25","Slimpickens1","",[],"<p>Lol. My post was funny though when you think about the visual.</p>"],[5,15854905,15853605,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T18:53:56","NE_Beaver","",[],"<p>exactly!!! LOL</p>"],[1,15857312,0,0,0,0,"2018-12-31T21:23:03","Stonenchizel","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://voat.co/u/Slimpickens1\">@Slimpickens1</a> In your post you spelled the word <em>leaper</em> when I'm sure you actually meant to write <em>leper</em> . it is an awesome post when written correctly because we all know <strong>Jesus</strong> is the ultimate goal and message of the post. You must not get angry for those who corrected you in saying that <em>Leaper or Leper</em> because we know that the Devil uses trickery in the wording of sayings about Jesus to <em>Steal Kill and Destroy</em> any that he can . I'm not saying you did anything intentional but there's actually a review button so you can proof read what you written so that way you don't make those mistakes and you can clean it up before you post.</p>\n<p><em>Peace &amp; May God Bless You</em></p>\n<p><strong>WWG1WGA</strong></p>"]]
